{"name_en": "Smbat Bagratuni (general of Tiridates III)", "zh": "斯姆巴特", "sei": "斯姆", "mei": "巴特", "zh_full": "斯姆巴特·巴格拉圖尼", "sex": "m", "years": [290, 300], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "亞美尼亞（阿沙克王朝）", "role": "武将", "place": "瓦加爾沙帕特", "lat": 40.16, "lon": 44.29, "offices": ["將軍"], "kin": [{"rel": "子", "name": "Bagarat Bagratuni (cavalry commander of Tiridates III)"}], "friends": ["Tiridates III of Armenia"], "foes": [], "bio": "巴格拉圖尼家族將軍，帕卡拉德之父。梯里達底三世歸國後，遣其往阿什卡塔爾處為王求娶其女阿什肯，促成王室婚姻。", "stats": [55, 52, 48, 52, 50], "lean": "騎", "conf": "C", "src": "Moses 2.83"}
